# Study outputs are NOT committed -- they are regenerated, not stored.
# Every number in docs/ cites a file under studies/results/<nn>_<name>/, but
# those files live only on your machine. To verify a claim, re-run the study
# that produced it; DIRECTORY.md maps each runner to its output folder.
# Full regeneration is roughly 40 minutes.
studies/results/







